	(text "U600 is the W25Q128JVSIQ configuration flash. FPGA_CFG_CLK, FPGA_CFG_CS_N\nand FPGA_CFG_D0 through FPGA_CFG_D3 connect it to U500. The flash and\nconfiguration bank use IO3V3. R601, R602 and R606 provide 10 kohm\npull-ups on select and the flash multifunction data pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 42.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0874e0f4-ce71-4cda-b082-8d5080ffff7f")
	)
	(text "FPGA flash and JTAG recovery"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.29 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "18ab9c9d-987a-4456-abae-2d941e47f95e")
	)
	(text "J600 exposes FPGA_JTAG_TCK, TMS, TDI and TDO, together with the indicated\nsupply reference and return. This path provides direct programming and recovery\naccess independently of the normal flash-loading path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 102.239 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "36868628-6e04-4388-8d03-4aed5145b480")
	)
	(text "FB600 filters AUX1V8 into the FPGA VCCADC pin. C601 and C602 provide 100\nnF and 470 nF local bypass. The shown external analog input and reference pins\nare grounded. XADC internal monitoring, when used, is selected and read by FPGA\nlogic or firmware; this sheet contains its supply connections."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 120.032 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "52f922ae-d25f-4e78-8b25-76b2a311d23d")
	)
	(text "JTAG service access"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 96.899 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7ef2e614-d631-4d15-8a91-1115b0500683")
	)
	(text "XADC analog supply"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 114.692 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8a9fadee-e7a1-406c-bda9-7889fef78c98")
	)
	(text "FPGA configuration and XADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a9459508-bc53-4e5a-9b13-b4e67f9833b7")
	)
	(text "M[2:0] = 001 selects Master SPI; CFGBVS connects to IO3V3. R603 and R605\nare 4.7 kohm pull-ups on INIT_N and PROGRAM_N; R604 is 10 kohm on DONE.\nFPGA_DONE and FPGA_INIT_N pass through U901 to the MCU PC6/PC7 inputs.\nThe status signals indicate configuration state; they do not prove application\nlogic, DDR calibration or communication readiness."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 62.306 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aa48c5c1-9388-41d6-9e9a-e6ca5adf44f7")
	)
	(text "Mode and status pins"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 56.966 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b5925d34-411a-41d9-b4fb-8336bb097193")
	)
	(text "FPGA configuration, recovery and XADC supply"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 14.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b8896be5-ca51-4f1f-96ee-962292e3eb2f")
	)
	(text "SW600 pulls FPGA_PROGRAM_N low. U601 is an SN74LVC1G07 open-drain\nbuffer driven by MCU_RESET_FPGA_N: low asserts PROGRAM_B; high releases it\nto R605. R600/R607 bias the input and C603 bypasses the buffer. A low\npulse followed by release restarts configuration after power-up. Holding\nPROGRAM_B low from initial power-on does not delay first configuration."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 82.273 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dbe6d3df-e811-41c9-bb20-bfefbdd49167")
	)
	(text "Manual and MCU recovery"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 76.933 0)
